WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.600
[ Death Note — Classic Clip ]

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.624
[pages of a notebook turning]

3
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.825
♪ low, unsettling drone ♪

4
00:00:10.401 --> 00:00:13.026
[pen scratching against paper]

5
00:00:13.602 --> 00:00:16.227
[distant church bells tolling]

6
00:00:16.803 --> 00:00:19.428
♪ heartbeat-like percussion ♪

7
00:00:20.004 --> 00:00:22.629
[quiet footsteps in an empty hall]

8
00:00:23.205 --> 00:00:25.830
♪ dissonant strings creep in ♪

9
00:00:26.406 --> 00:00:29.031
[a slow, deliberate laugh]

10
00:00:29.607 --> 00:00:32.232
♪ tension builds to silence ♪

11
00:00:32.808 --> 00:00:35.433
[a single piano note hangs in the air]

